@SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress = http://localhost:5181

### Create user using the supplied form fields
POST {{SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress}}/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice&email=alice%40example.com

###

### Reject invalid email input
POST {{SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress}}/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice&email=not-an-email

### Get a created user (replace 1 with the returned ID)
GET {{SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress}}/users/1
Accept: application/json

### The existing sample endpoint
GET {{SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
